{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"groupID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV09directoryC2Dn7groupIDACSS_SStcfc"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"groupID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"directoryGroupDn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group."}]},{"type":"text","text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"who names a group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"admins"},{"type":"text","text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"type":"text","text":" are the same row."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant."}],"title":"GroupMapping","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","type":"topic"}}}